    "detailed_description": "Experience an unparalleled eco-adventure in &quot;Eco Quest: Explore, Discover, Protect!&quot; Put yourself in the shoes of <strong>Kai</strong>, an ardent environmentalist hell-bent on changing the way people around the globe think about water and the environment.<br><br>Kai faces obstacles, mysteries, and encounters reflecting real-life problems on his trip through a world of wastefulness and disregard for environmental concerns. Kai embarks on a mission to ignite a flame of reform by revolutionising communities' detrimental traditions, armed with information, invention, and unrelenting drive.<br><br>This is more than just a game; it's a call to arms, a chance to join Kai on a mission where your small contribution goes a big way towards creating a better, more sustainable world. In &quot;Eco Quest: Explore, Discover, Protect!,&quot; your actions have a significant impact.",
    "about_the_game": "Experience an unparalleled eco-adventure in &quot;Eco Quest: Explore, Discover, Protect!&quot; Put yourself in the shoes of <strong>Kai</strong>, an ardent environmentalist hell-bent on changing the way people around the globe think about water and the environment.<br><br>Kai faces obstacles, mysteries, and encounters reflecting real-life problems on his trip through a world of wastefulness and disregard for environmental concerns. Kai embarks on a mission to ignite a flame of reform by revolutionising communities' detrimental traditions, armed with information, invention, and unrelenting drive.<br><br>This is more than just a game; it's a call to arms, a chance to join Kai on a mission where your small contribution goes a big way towards creating a better, more sustainable world. In &quot;Eco Quest: Explore, Discover, Protect!,&quot; your actions have a significant impact.",
